      "ZSC-06(e) Baker rigidity and ZSC-06(f)",
      "RIO-09 upper window for the zero run; ZSC-03 Corollaries 1-2",
      "ZSC-01, ZSC-02 Theorem (a)-(d), ZSC-04, ZSC-05, (CH), normality, RH"
